{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-applications","title":"图神经网络应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/graph-applications","wordCount":953,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"图神经网络应用\">图神经网络应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图神经网络的应用覆盖了从推荐系统到药物发现、从交通预测到程序分析的广泛领域。根据预测粒度的不同，GNN 的任务可以分为三个层次：节点级（预测单个节点的属性）、边级（预测节点间的关系）和图级（预测整个图的属性）。理解这三类任务的建模方式和训练策略是将 GNN 应用到实际问题的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph GNN 任务层次&#10;        A[&quot;节点级任务&lt;br/&gt;节点分类/回归&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;GNN 编码器&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;边级任务&lt;br/&gt;链接预测&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;        C[&quot;图级任务&lt;br/&gt;图分类/回归&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;任务特定解码器&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph GNN 任务层次\n        A[\"节点级任务&lt;br/&gt;节点分类/回归\"] --&gt; D[\"GNN 编码器\"]\n        B[\"边级任务&lt;br/&gt;链接预测\"] --&gt; D\n        C[\"图级任务&lt;br/&gt;图分类/回归\"] --&gt; D\n    end\n    D --&gt; E[\"任务特定解码器\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>预测目标</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n<th>输出方式</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点分类</td>\n<td>节点标签</td>\n<td>论文分类、欺诈检测</td>\n<td>节点嵌入 → 分类器</td>\n<td>GCN, GAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接预测</td>\n<td>边是否存在</td>\n<td>推荐系统、知识图谱</td>\n<td>节点对 → 打分</td>\n<td>GraphSAGE, R-GCN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图分类</td>\n<td>图标签</td>\n<td>分子性质、蛋白质功能</td>\n<td>图嵌入 → 分类器</td>\n<td>GIN, DiffPool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图回归</td>\n<td>图数值</td>\n<td>药物活性、材料性质</td>\n<td>图嵌入 → 回归器</td>\n<td>SchNet, DimeNet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图生成</td>\n<td>新图</td>\n<td>分子设计、场景生成</td>\n<td>自回归/一步生成</td>\n<td>GraphVAE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐系统中的-gnn\">推荐系统中的 GNN</h2><p>推荐系统本质上是一个二部图上的链接预测问题：用户和物品作为两种节点，历史交互作为边，任务是预测未来可能出现的边。GNN 通过在这个二部图上进行消息传递来学习用户和物品的嵌入表示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;from torch_geometric.nn import SAGEConv&#10;&#10;class LightGCN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_users, num_items, embed_dim, num_layers):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.user_emb = nn.Embedding(num_users, embed_dim)&#10;        self.item_emb = nn.Embedding(num_items, embed_dim)&#10;        self.num_layers = num_layers&#10;        self.convs = nn.ModuleList([&#10;            SAGEConv(embed_dim, embed_dim) for _ in range(num_layers)&#10;        ])&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, edge_index):&#10;        x = torch.cat([self.user_emb.weight, self.item_emb.weight])&#10;        all_embeddings = [x]&#10;        for conv in self.convs:&#10;            x = conv(x, edge_index)&#10;            all_embeddings.append(x)&#10;        final = torch.stack(all_embeddings, dim=0).mean(dim=0)&#10;        return final\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SAGEConv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LightGCN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_users, num_items, embed_dim, num_layers):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.user_emb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(num_users, embed_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.item_emb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(num_items, embed_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_layers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.convs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ModuleList([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            SAGEConv(embed_dim, embed_dim) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, edge_index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.user_emb.weight, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.item_emb.weight])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        all_embeddings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [x]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.convs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conv(x, edge_index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            all_embeddings.append(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        final </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.stack(all_embeddings, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> final</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PinSage（Pinterest）是工业级 GNN 推荐系统的典范。它使用随机游走采样邻居、重要性池化聚合消息，能够在包含 30 亿节点和 180 亿边的图上进行高效训练和推理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>推荐 GNN</th>\n<th>核心设计</th>\n<th>图类型</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LightGCN</td>\n<td>简化 GCN，仅聚合</td>\n<td>用户-物品二部图</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PinSage</td>\n<td>随机游走 + 重要性采样</td>\n<td>物品-物品图</td>\n<td>十亿级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UltraGCN</td>\n<td>无显式消息传递</td>\n<td>用户-物品二部图</td>\n<td>千万级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"药物发现与分子性质预测\">药物发现与分子性质预测</h2><p>分子天然是图结构：原子是节点，化学键是边。GNN 可以直接在分子图上学习，预测溶解度、毒性、药物-靶点结合亲和力等性质。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torch_geometric.nn import GINConv, global_add_pool&#10;&#10;class MoleculeGNN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, atom_feat_dim, hidden_dim, num_tasks):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv1 = GINConv(nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(atom_feat_dim, hidden_dim),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),&#10;        ))&#10;        self.conv2 = GINConv(nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),&#10;        ))&#10;        self.predictor = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_tasks)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, data):&#10;        x = torch.relu(self.conv1(data.x, data.edge_index))&#10;        x = torch.relu(self.conv2(x, data.edge_index))&#10;        x = global_add_pool(x, data.batch)&#10;        return self.predictor(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GINConv, global_add_pool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MoleculeGNN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, atom_feat_dim, hidden_dim, num_tasks):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GINConv(nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(atom_feat_dim, hidden_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GINConv(nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, hidden_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.predictor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(hidden_dim, num_tasks)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1(data.x, data.edge_index))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2(x, data.edge_index))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> global_add_pool(x, data.batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.predictor(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 分子图处理流程&#10;        A[&quot;SMILES 字符串&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;分子图构建&lt;br/&gt;原子→节点&lt;br/&gt;键→边&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;GNN 编码&lt;br/&gt;多轮消息传递&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;图读出&lt;br/&gt;全局池化&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; E[&quot;性质预测&lt;br/&gt;回归/分类&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 分子图处理流程\n        A[\"SMILES 字符串\"] --&gt; B[\"分子图构建&lt;br/&gt;原子→节点&lt;br/&gt;键→边\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"GNN 编码&lt;br/&gt;多轮消息传递\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"图读出&lt;br/&gt;全局池化\"]\n        D --&gt; E[\"性质预测&lt;br/&gt;回归/分类\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"交通预测与时空图\">交通预测与时空图</h2><p>交通流量预测是一个典型的时空预测问题：空间上，交通节点（路口、路段）构成一个图；时间上，流量数据是一个序列。时空图神经网络（STGNN）结合图卷积和时间卷积/RNN 来同时捕捉空间依赖和时间动态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class STGNNBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, spatial_channels, temporal_channels, num_nodes):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.temporal1 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, temporal_channels, kernel_size=(1, 3), padding=(0, 1))&#10;        self.spatial = GCNConv(temporal_channels, spatial_channels)&#10;        self.temporal2 = nn.Conv2d(spatial_channels, in_channels, kernel_size=(1, 3), padding=(0, 1))&#10;        self.norm = nn.LayerNorm([num_nodes, in_channels])&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, edge_index):&#10;        residual = x&#10;        x = torch.relu(self.temporal1(x.permute(0, 3, 1, 2)).permute(0, 2, 3, 1))&#10;        b, n, t, c = x.shape&#10;        x = x.reshape(b * t, n, c)&#10;        x = torch.relu(self.spatial(x, edge_index))&#10;        x = x.reshape(b, n, t, -1)&#10;        x = torch.relu(self.temporal2(x.permute(0, 3, 1, 2)).permute(0, 2, 3, 1))&#10;        return self.norm(x + residual)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> STGNNBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, spatial_channels, temporal_channels, num_nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, temporal_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spatial </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GCNConv(temporal_channels, spatial_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(spatial_channels, in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LayerNorm([num_nodes, in_channels])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, edge_index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal1(x.permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b, n, t, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.reshape(b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t, n, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spatial(x, edge_index))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.reshape(b, n, t, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temporal2(x.permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> residual)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>空间建模</th>\n<th>时间建模</th>\n<th>典型数据集</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>STGCN</td>\n<td>ChebNet</td>\n<td>因果卷积</td>\n<td>METR-LA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCRNN</td>\n<td>扩散卷积</td>\n<td>GRU</td>\n<td>PEMS-BAY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Graph WaveNet</td>\n<td>自适应图</td>\n<td>膨胀卷积</td>\n<td>METR-LA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"程序分析与代码理解\">程序分析与代码理解</h2><p>程序的抽象语法树（AST）和控制流图（CFG）天然是图结构。GNN 可以在这些程序图上学习代码的语义表示，用于漏洞检测、代码克隆检测和自动修复等任务。</p>\n<p>在漏洞检测中，将源代码转换为代码属性图（CPG），结合 AST、控制流和数据流信息，然后用 GNN 学习代码片段是否包含安全漏洞。这种方法比基于文本序列的方法更能捕捉程序的结构语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((GNN 应用))&#10;    推荐系统&#10;      LightGCN&#10;      PinSage&#10;      用户-物品图&#10;    药物发现&#10;      分子图&#10;      性质预测&#10;      药物设计&#10;    交通预测&#10;      时空图&#10;      STGCN&#10;      实时预测&#10;    程序分析&#10;      AST/CFG&#10;      漏洞检测&#10;      代码理解\">mindmap\n  root((GNN 应用))\n    推荐系统\n      LightGCN\n      PinSage\n      用户-物品图\n    药物发现\n      分子图\n      性质预测\n      药物设计\n    交通预测\n      时空图\n      STGCN\n      实时预测\n    程序分析\n      AST/CFG\n      漏洞检测\n      代码理解</pre><ul>\n<li>GNN 任务分为节点级、边级和图级三个层次</li>\n<li>推荐系统将用户-物品交互建模为二部图上的链接预测</li>\n<li>分子性质预测将原子和键作为节点和边，通过图读出获得分子表示</li>\n<li>时空图网络结合图卷积和时间建模处理交通等动态预测任务</li>\n<li>程序图上的 GNN 可以捕捉代码的结构语义，用于漏洞检测等任务</li>\n<li>选择 GNN 方案时需要考虑图的规模、异构性和实时性需求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图神经网络应用","id":"图神经网络应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐系统中的 GNN","id":"推荐系统中的-gnn"},{"level":2,"text":"药物发现与分子性质预测","id":"药物发现与分子性质预测"},{"level":2,"text":"交通预测与时空图","id":"交通预测与时空图"},{"level":2,"text":"程序分析与代码理解","id":"程序分析与代码理解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GNN 主要变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/gnn-variants"},"next":{"title":"优化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/optimization-algorithms"}}